README file for dltools package
Ryan Dalzell
21st January 2020

OVERVIEW
--------

dltools is a package of several tools for the Blackmagic Decklink
series of cards. Currently the utilities are:

dlplay: video player, supports file and network input and
        can play raw yuv, yuv4mpeg2 (y4m) and mpeg2, h.264 and
        hevc video codecs and mpeg2 and ac3 audio codecs.

dlcap:  video recorder, captures raw yuv data in supported formats

dlcard: displays a test card, currently colour bars with optional
        caption, video mode text, timecode and tone

dlsync: plays a test card, timecode and tone out of the card and receives
        them back through an external chain, reporting its latency and
        lipsync; calibrate first with -c on a loopback cable

dlinfo: looks for compatible cards and reports supported formats

dlskel: skeleton application to use as template for further utilities
 

INSTALLATION
------------

Please read file "INSTALL" for detailed installation instructions.
